  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Dialogue to End Conflict in Oromia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">aims to support the political dialogue facilitation effort towards finding a peaceful resolution to the regional armed conflict in Oromia region and enhancing local capacity for grassroot level mediation, conflict prevention and peacebuilding activities following a multi-track engagement strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
